meta {
  name: List Overall Result Group Names
  type: http
  seq: 6
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/overall-result-templates/group-names?page=1&limit=20&search=cul
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  page: 1
  limit: 20
  search: cul
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{businessAccessToken}}
}

docs {
  Distinct, active `groupName` values in the caller's tenant, alphabetical,
  **server-side paginated and searched** (standard `{ success, data, meta }`
  envelope — `meta.total`/`page`/`limit`/`totalPages`, same as every other
  list endpoint). Populates the "Overall Result" group picker in the Add
  Multiple Results dialog's per-parameter "Configure: [Parameter]" panel,
  where a `LabTestResultParam` links to one or more of these group names via
  `overallResultGroups` (see Lab Tests → Create/Update Lab Test for that
  field).

  ## Query params (all optional)

  - `page` (default 1), `limit` (default 20, max 100).
  - `search` — case-insensitive substring match against the group name.

  Declared before `GET /overall-result-templates/:id` so it is not matched as
  an id.
}
